/1/episode/5"},{"id":"4579520","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"All the girls gather together to discuss the terrible curse placed on their scale that makes it seem like they weigh more than they should. Akagami, Yuzuki, and Mia begin their training for tokudo to become proper priests.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-08-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":5.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qPvDtVJT2qZgmqEoIx5l4s5Tq8h.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qPvDtVJT2qZgmqEoIx5l4s5Tq8h.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/218613/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"4579521","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A new deadline puts pressure on the temple trainees to prepare for tokudo. As such, Kiki guides them through both conventional and unconventional training. As Christmas approaches, Akagami faces unpleasant memories while Yuzuki tries to cheer him up.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-08-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":3.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9FIF3tD0HAB0ym1gY0Y0BdG6Cw9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9FIF3tD0HAB0ym1gY0Y0BdG6Cw9.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/218613/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"4579522","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"All of the temple residents come together to celebrate Christmas. After gifts are exchanged, accidental intimacy is interrupted by harsh reality. Lurking treachery threatens Akagami's place at the temple.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-08-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":3.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uugaELt3sICd6sN2W4qa0F3WOff.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uugaELt3sICd6sN2W4qa0F3WOff.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/218613/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"4579523","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The residents of Mikazuki temple engage in their end-of-year tradition of pounding mochi. Several of them get hot and bothered while dealing with some of the implications of all the pounding going on at the temple.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-09-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":5.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mSm7pSA7EoS3TO7nuUEagdHYXUo.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mSm7pSA7EoS3TO7nuUEagdHYXUo.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/218613/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"4579524","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Akagami's unease around Kagura pushes Mia to force them together. With the temple approaching destitution, Akagami, Mia, and Yuzuki call on the temple parishioners to help them pull through. However, their responses aren't quite what they expected.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-09-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":5.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/VuWZpRGw995zg4xZJ9uHleJZy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/VuWZpRGw995zg4xZJ9uHleJZy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/218613/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"4579525","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With the ceremony fast approaching, the residents of Mikazuki temple are scrambling to come up with the funds to repair the temple's principal figure. To do his part, Akagami reaches out to the Aoba sisters and ask